// File:    std/compiler_regress_test.skink
// Purpose: Regression tests for compiler bug fixes found in the
//          comprehensive audit (numeric literals, typed switch,
//          continue-in-switch, dot/norm, len(chan), closed-channel
//          receive, spawn lifetimes, ranges, tagged unions,
//          panic/recover, slice bounds, writable string literals).
